{
  "_comment": [
    "Friendly resource-type names mapped to Cloud Asset Inventory asset types.",
    "The authoritative copy: app/core.py loads this, and scripts/ reads it with jq,",
    "so the mapping cannot drift between the tool and its differential checks.",
    "Not a limit on what can be searched -- raw CAI asset types and RE2 patterns are",
    "accepted anywhere a friendly name is, so a missing entry is a convenience gap.",
    "Site-specific overrides are deliberately not supported yet; see Phase 3."
  ],
